WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.249
The mast falls before the fire.

2
00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:06.487
Warnings are usually timed by when the fire arrives.

3
00:00:06.837 --> 00:00:09.546
But masts burn first, and coverage goes with them.

4
00:00:09.896 --> 00:00:13.672
Here, the town loses its mast fifty-three minutes before the warning deadline.

5
00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:19.697
SENDA crosses the fire front with the masts and warns in time, or via satellite, LoRa and neighbours.

6
00:00:21.097 --> 00:00:23.251
Open source. Try it on the website.
